        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "岩の面に刻まれた文字は、長い年月を経てもなお読み取ることができた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "川の面が朝日を受けてきらめき、渡し場の船頭が目を細めた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "大理石の面を磨き上げると、鏡のように人影が映り込むほど光沢が出た。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
